    "RestInputRequest": {
      "$defs": {
        "JsonValue": {}
      },
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Structured request for rendering a REST TOML input card.\n\nExtra fields are rejected. ``xc`` is normalized to its canonical casing\nand checked against the REST method catalog during validation. The basis\npool root is deployment configuration (``AIFS_BASIS_SET_POOL``), not a\nrequest field: ``basis`` is only the name inside that pool.",
